<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hyal shares tumble on reinstatement.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hyal shares tumble on reinstatement.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hyal Pharmaceuticals Australia Ltd tumble over 20 percent at the opening on Friday following the reinstatement of its shares today following a dispute with its parent Hyal Pharmaceutical Corp.</p>
<p>At 10.15 a.m. (23.15 a.m.) Hyal shares were nine cents or 23.08 percent lower at 30 cents.  </p>
<p>Hyal said its parent, which owns 60 percent of the Australian company, proposes to call an extraordinary shareholders meeting to consider removal of the Australian company's board.</p>
<p>-- Kevin Morrison 61-2 9373-1813</p>
